#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/details/performance.rs:375
msgid "On an AMD X3D processor the profile can prefer the CCD with the extra cache (cache) or the faster one (freq)."
msgstr "På en AMD X3D-prosessor kan profilen foretrekke CCD-en med ekstra hurtigbuffer (cache) eller den raskeste (freq)."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/widgets/info.rs:182
msgid "On processors with a single CCD (such as the Ryzen 7 7800X3D or 9800X3D) every core already has the cache, and processors without 3D V-Cache have nothing to choose. There the driver is absent, and Big Game Mode shows the option as not supported instead of a control that would do nothing."
msgstr "På prosessorer med én CCD (som Ryzen 7 7800X3D eller 9800X3D) har alle kjerner allerede hurtigbufferen, og prosessorer uten 3D V-Cache har ingenting å velge. Der mangler driveren, og Big Game Mode viser valget som ikke støttet i stedet for en kontroll som ikke ville gjort noe."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/widgets/info.rs:161
msgid "On the reference desktop no scheduler or mode made Shadow of the Tomb Raider faster than the kernel's own scheduler. Try one when a game stutters, and keep it only if it helps."
msgstr "På referansemaskinen gjorde ingen planlegger eller modus Shadow of the Tomb Raider raskere enn kjernens egen planlegger. Prøv en når et spill hakker, og behold den bare hvis den hjelper."

